    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pointdexter is a 2D puzzle platformer where tiles can be drawn, and will move in the same direction as you do. Use pencils, erasers, and even other doodles to solve every puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Artist hasn\u2019t been able to draw due to artist\u2019s block. Well? Go find this block and blow it to pieces. Play as Pointdexter, a doodle in The Artist\u2019s sketchbook, and draw tiles with your trusty pencils to reach new pages and put an end to the artist\u2019s block.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pointdexter is a 2D puzzle platformer where tiles can be drawn, and will move in the same direction as you do. Use pencils, erasers, and even other doodles to solve every puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Artist hasn\u2019t been able to draw due to artist\u2019s block. Well? Go find this block and blow it to pieces. Play as Pointdexter, a doodle in The Artist\u2019s sketchbook, and draw tiles with your trusty pencils to reach new pages and put an end to the artist\u2019s block.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tiles will copy your moves. Use pencils to draw bridges and get to the next page!",
